  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-26T21:08:58.934Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I doubt that this is a common issue given there are literally billions of combinations of CPU/GPU's/Ram/OS and everything else.\nBut for whatever reason Vrchat's build of EAC uses 70% more cpu utilization while running compared to other games running EAC on my machine.\nMy hardware specs aren't the best, just a 1660super and ryzen 1600x with a bit of an overclock but my fps has dipped into the low 10's in empty worlds since the security update.\n\nBefore I could be in most worlds with about 10-15 players before I dipped below 60, unless they were using inefficient avatars.",
